    "title": "Why Uzbekistan Imports Rice Despite Producing Its Own",
    "url": "https://novastan.org/en/uzbekistan/why-uzbekistan-imports-rice/",
    "snippet": "Why Uzbekistan Imports Rice Despite Producing Its Own Uzbekistan produces enough rice to meet its domestic demand, yet continues to import from Kazakhstan, India and Pakistan while exporting to neighbouring countries. What explains these trade flows? An examination of domestic production, consumer preferences, prices and evolving transport routes reveals a complex regional rice market. The post Why Uzbekistan Imports Rice Despite Producing Its Own appeared first on Novastan English .",
